<i>This time I'm giving up for good</i>

00:13:28.083 --> 00:13:34.250
<i>How should I pretend
That I never loved you</i>

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.958
<i>I'm not even a fallback guy</i>

00:13:39.041 --> 00:13:42.041
<i>Don't want to be the shadow of love</i>

00:13:42.125 --> 00:13:47.166
<i>Now I'm crying in silence
Deciding to give up on you</i>

00:13:47.291 --> 00:13:50.083
<i>Perhaps we're destined</i>

00:13:50.166 --> 00:13:53.750
<i>To not to be together</i>

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:58.833
<i>I make it as though I never met you</i>

